---
description: Mandatory security rules for formulas and rendering
alwaysApply: true
---

- User content is data, never code.
- Do not use eval, exec, dynamic imports, shell interpolation, raw sympify, or shell=true.
- Accept only schema-valid nodes and allowlisted expression AST operations.
- Enforce complexity, domain, sampling, duration, frame, and output limits server-side.
- Render jobs run non-root, without network, with bounded CPU, memory, processes, disk, and time.
- Do not weaken a validation or isolation control to make a test pass.
